{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1749120/extras/2560a4654a83be7a0315b1242de56e14.avif?t=1763095116\" width=448 height=252 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>RollRiddle: Cube'n'Roll \u2013 The Ultimate Rolling Adventure Begins!</strong></u></h2>RollRiddle - Cube'n'Roll, the ultimate rolling adventure is here! This game takes players on a journey through five acts and over 100 levels of exciting and challenging gameplay.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1749120/extras/b7adfdd54a9205385e1f667e51ebb0f0.poster.avif?t=1763095116\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1749120/extras/b7adfdd54a9205385e1f667e51ebb0f0.webm?t=1763095116\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1749120/extras/b7adfdd54a9205385e1f667e51ebb0f0.mp4?t=1763095116\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>Overcome Obstacles and Master Unique Challenges in Each Act!</u></h2>As players progress through the levels, they'll come across a variety of obstacles, such as spikes and moving platforms, that they must overcome to reach the end of the level. Each act features unique themes and environments, and players must use their skills and experience to conquer them.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1749120/extras/907e0cfb315e0039eea8d70d964898e4.poster.avif?t=1763095116\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1749120/extras/907e0cfb315e0039eea8d70d964898e4.webm?t=1763095116\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1749120/extras/907e0cfb315e0039eea8d70d964898e4.mp4?t=1763095116\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>Customize Your Ball with Unique Skins to Express Your Style!</u></h2>One of the most exciting features of RollRiddle - Cube'n'Roll is the ability to change the skin of the ball, players can customize their ball's appearance with a wide variety of skins, including classic designs and fun, creative skins, to make their ball stand out and express their personality.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1749120/extras/7671f8c3c42aa19a285666e9ca1d6e8c.poster.avif?t=1763095116\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1749120/extras/7671f8c3c42aa19a285666e9ca1d6e8c.webm?t=1763095116\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1749120/extras/7671f8c3c42aa19a285666e9ca1d6e8c.mp4?t=1763095116\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>Unlock Achievements and Boost Replayability as You Progress!</u></h2>Another exciting feature of RollRiddle - Cube'n'Roll is the ability to unlock achievements as you progress through the game. These achievements can range from completing a certain number of levels, to collecting a certain number of points, and more. Unlocking achievements not only adds to the replayability of the game but also give players a sense of accomplishment.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>Climb the Ranks and Compete Without Comparing Scores!</u></h2>In addition to the main levels, RollRiddle - Cube'n'Roll also features a ranking system that allows players to see how they rank against other players in the game, without being exposed to other player's scores.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>Yourself in Vibrant Art and Explore Hidden Wonders!</u></h2>The game's unique art style and lively colors will engage players to continue the journey and explore the land, discovering hidden areas and enjoying the game.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1749120/extras/148ec18d8922a6d1a04fbeb65f610be4.poster.avif?t=1763095116\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1749120/extras/148ec18d8922a6d1a04fbeb65f610be4.webm?t=1763095116\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1749120/extras/148ec18d8922a6d1a04fbeb65f610be4.mp4?t=1763095116\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>RollRiddle: Cube'n'Roll \u2013 A Fun and Engaging Adventure for All Ages!</u></h2>Overall, RollRiddle - Cube'n'Roll is a charming and engaging game that will appeal to players of all ages and skill levels. With its five acts, over 100 levels, unlockable achievements, a ranking system, and the ability to change the ball's skin, RollMe is sure to provide hours of entertainment for players everywhere.","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Tutorial completed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1749120/0a89fa511f58c5afc1d6cb149946bb28a66e0362.jpg"},{"name":"Act I","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1749120/b422acf771b805b0a4a2c4e9731a4ca89abd5f61.jpg"},{"name":"Act II","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1749120/681450e1a7157c0ef9936ac02bad53ae8ad12daf.jpg"},{"name":"Act III","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1749120/9abf1824d326bbf79e9ed493f9707220bcedcd23.jpg"},{"name":"Act IV","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1749120/c4b9919342e9c765b78234c1